# ── 22 Sep: .env.bak-0919 reached GitHub through `git add -A`.
# The list above named .env, .env.backup, .env.production and
# .env.docker-local one by one, and a file called .env.bak-0919 matched none
# of them. Naming each variant is how this happens; these are patterns.
.env.bak*
.env.*bak*
.env-*
*.v1.bak
*_commit_msg.txt
COMMIT_MSG.txt
PUSH_*.bat
AMEND_*.bat
_release/DEPLOY_*.sh
